<title>HONG KONG: Hanny mulls trading unit spinoff in U.S.</title>
<headline>Hanny mulls trading unit spinoff in U.S.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Floppy disk maker Hanny Holdings Ltd said on Tuesday it was considering seeking a separate listing of its trading division, which is headed by its wholly-owned Memtek Products Inc, in the United States.</p>
<p>&quot;It is the intention of the company to obtain, if possible, such a separate listing for its trading division in the near future and the relevant preliminary feasibility studies are being undertaken,&quot; said Hanny director Ken Cheung.</p>
<p>&quot;However, no concrete plan relating to such proposal listing has been finalised.&quot; Cheung said.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6370</p>
